%% ==========================================================================
%% PROCESSUS BPMN — Authentification 2FA TOTP (RFC 6238)
%% Statut: IMPLEMENTÉ (TwoFactorService — pyotp + Fernet encryption)
%% Référence code: packages/backend/app/modules/auth/services/
%%   - two_factor_service.py
%%   - auth_service.py
%%   - jwt_service.py
%%   - session_service.py
%% Tables: users.totp_secret_encrypted, users.totp_enabled, sessions, refresh_tokens
%% ==========================================================================
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant Web as Frontend Next.js
    participant API as Backend FastAPI
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant Auth as Authenticator App Google/Authy
    participant Email as Email Service
    participant Audit as audit_logs

    Note over User,Audit: PHASE A — Login initial avec mot de passe
    User->>Web: Saisit email + mot de passe
    Web->>API: POST /api/v1/auth/login
    API->>DB: SELECT users WHERE email
    API->>API: bcrypt.verify password 12 rounds
    alt Mot de passe invalide
        API->>Audit: LOGIN_FAILED + IP + UA
        API-->>Web: 401 Unauthorized
    end
    API->>DB: SELECT totp_enabled WHERE user_id
    alt 2FA non activé
        API->>API: jwt_service.create_access_token 30min
        API->>API: create_refresh_token 30j
        API->>DB: INSERT sessions + refresh_tokens
        API->>Audit: LOGIN_SUCCESS
        API-->>Web: access_token + refresh_token
    else 2FA activé
        API->>API: Génère challenge_token courte durée 5min
        API-->>Web: requires_2fa=true + challenge_token
        Web-->>User: Affiche écran code TOTP 6 chiffres

        Note over User,Auth: PHASE B — Validation code TOTP
        User->>Auth: Ouvre app authenticator
        Auth-->>User: Affiche code 6 chiffres TTL 30s
        User->>Web: Saisit code + valide
        Web->>API: POST /api/v1/auth/2fa/verify avec challenge_token + code
        API->>API: jwt_service.verify challenge_token
        API->>DB: SELECT totp_secret_encrypted
        API->>API: Fernet.decrypt secret
        API->>API: pyotp.TOTP.verify code, valid_window=1
        alt Code invalide
            API->>Audit: 2FA_FAILED
            API-->>Web: 401 + remaining_attempts
        else Code valide
            API->>API: jwt_service.create_access_token 30min
            API->>API: create_refresh_token 30j
            API->>DB: INSERT sessions + refresh_tokens
            API->>Audit: LOGIN_SUCCESS_2FA
            API-->>Web: access_token + refresh_token
            Web-->>User: Redirect dashboard
        end
    end

    Note over User,Audit: PHASE C — Setup initial 2FA optionnel après login
    User->>Web: Settings — Activer 2FA
    Web->>API: POST /api/v1/auth/2fa/setup
    API->>API: pyotp.random_base32 secret
    API->>API: Génère QR code SVG otpauth://totp/Facil:user@email?secret=...
    API->>API: Fernet.encrypt secret avec TOTP_ENCRYPTION_KEY
    API->>DB: UPDATE users SET totp_secret_encrypted, totp_enabled=false en attente confirmation
    API-->>Web: qr_code_svg + manual_secret
    Web-->>User: Affiche QR + secret texte
    User->>Auth: Scan QR ou saisie manuelle
    User->>Web: Saisit code de confirmation
    Web->>API: POST /api/v1/auth/2fa/enable + code
    API->>API: pyotp.TOTP.verify code
    alt Code valide
        API->>DB: UPDATE users SET totp_enabled=true
        API->>API: Génère 10 backup_codes hashés bcrypt
        API->>DB: INSERT users.backup_codes_hashed
        API->>Email: Envoi email confirmation 2FA activé
        API->>Audit: 2FA_ENABLED
        API-->>Web: success + backup_codes affichés une seule fois
        Web-->>User: Affiche codes de récupération à imprimer
    end
